{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule sync_wedge #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2\n)(\n    input  clk_i,\n    input  rst_ni,\n    input  en_i,\n    input  serial_i,\n    output r_edge_o,\n    output f_edge_o,\n    output serial_o\n);\n\n    localparam SYNC_DEPTH = (STAGES < 2) ? 2 : STAGES;\n\n    reg [SYNC_DEPTH-1:0] sync_reg;\n    reg                  prev_sync;\n    reg                  r_edge;\n    reg                  f_edge;\n\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni) begin\n            sync_reg <= {SYNC_DEPTH{1'b0}};\n            prev_sync <= 1'b0;\n            r_edge    <= 1'b0;\n            f_edge    <= 1'b0;\n        end else begin\n            sync_reg <= {sync_reg[SYNC_DEPTH-2:0], serial_i};\n            prev_sync <= sync_reg[SYNC_DEPTH-1];\n            r_edge    <= en_i & sync_reg[SYNC_DEPTH-1] & ~prev_sync;\n            f_edge    <= en_i & ~sync_reg[SYNC_DEPTH-1] & prev_sync;\n        end\n    end\n\n    assign serial_o = sync_reg[SYNC_DEPTH-1];\n    assign r_edge_o = r_edge;\n    assign f_edge_o = f_edge;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
